{
  "format": 1,
  "id": "id/bipa6.u03",
  "language": "id",
  "unit": "bipa6.u03",
  "version": 1,
  "content_hash": "c19fd5dd0b94ce80b3ef2e5fd9a52bf04dde991fdaf06b6715f09b48e7b28f7a",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u03.l01",
      "sha256": "55b6b24de632e6d3dfc8ff0f11f9bb97435ac3b5c5ca5f705ca285e2c23ddaba"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u03.l02",
      "sha256": "fc7f77784f400a3d83efd840b64e85da864b64b5f1829cd9bf280095dac55c1e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u03.l03",
      "sha256": "8b5356b760362191ed65bf0d3c389619db22f20c4abd24a28077e70483ca83ae"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u03.l04",
      "sha256": "62ac595554d55e4ca7f5097c98fcacd438e64936435496e3b8f93b1ac165caf3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u03.l05",
      "sha256": "8acd9517d55a05965c804bbf37cec81e697b6fdc1e02a84c7e0f2cc404f20831"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa6.u03.l06",
      "sha256": "3667c3f10b4307c3d9cfb71c626bb6f13c5df7c131280dd22acc42395758adc2"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "018fba5d636797c60ac0a97d59676c9d6462486d3aa6397c010c39a36704be13",
      "text": "Warisan pribadi dibagi menurut syarak, tetapi pusaka menurut adat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 66,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "02286258f43a71cb772eba080dd15af48167ffc044b9b50b64c017a4e18111d3",
      "text": "Dan peribahasanya, kan? Ingat, di mana bumi dipijak …",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "04247bdcb87a922f194a42cb035a48bc9b7308fda1072cc173f64130284c42fd",
      "text": "patrilineal",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0554fa439d33cb8141c7b3c82c12030eb74b0dbfcb33c49178989cc939c19311",
      "text": "mamak",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a95254d5fe2fdb0f259852dfba1248c39192becd600e1e7306b38f59df8d377",
      "text": "Menarik sekali. Ternyata ada banyak cara untuk menjaga keluarga.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ca5388b9e57d37d274318c35d3fa8a3bbbae2437d39196d7e0053ab1dde688d",
      "text": "syarak",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0e50b73837efe01de0eb0c8922f0c99cc971fe5bbeee788e5f3254cf579e33e8",
      "text": "Saya belajar bahasa Indonesia sedikit demi sedikit setiap hari.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "131892943b5b5962d1e20a680b11f53cf2bbd1329defadbe1dbec61fd1f4c8fa",
      "text": "Kedua budaya serupa, sedikit demi sedikit saya memahaminya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "16c59d383f069f367a23f830aeede5017297b329b0210fd2576972f7e9b47657",
      "text": "Pertanyaan bagus. Pusaka ikut adat, tetapi warisan pribadi ikut syarak. Itu hasil mufakat para ulama dan pemuka adat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 117,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "22e495ddab59d82d64839ab418de2259fa422715fc8d4ebf8a2c261cbdfa46a5",
      "text": "Masyarakat Mesir bersifat patrilineal, tetapi peran ibu tetap besar.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2379d53bacfa30796b3b0bdf9127db4362b3c07b24b9e21702fcb7fd8d328ffe",
      "text": "Rumah gadang ini milik nenek saya, lalu ibu saya, lalu adik perempuan saya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2397fd66e1a64dc604e2a75e2dd25f7ec4443d168ad23781fe6df07161f8f4d5",
      "text": "surau",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "269a732b8aaeb4f5cbdc5365ecd497fbf41da218ac93ec03eabead6841251600",
      "text": "Jadi Uda tidak dapat bagian?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 28,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "272971beb244d5eb57463d568bfe7af2308b19ce5662c34a1904dd7b57faf32d",
      "text": "Biasanya kakek dari pihak ayah. Sebaliknya, di sini mamak yang penting.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 71,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "29756083aca10e47125d0e957a57e8f1f603a83491ad1fb06e981ee50b63838d",
      "text": "Keputusan itu diambil secara mufakat setelah musyawarah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2a07ec13b56c6c8cdc6366379d663ed2e2961a6736dd8f567d13aa45125ec001",
      "text": "Syarak bersendi Kitabullah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 27,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "30ddec3670b6161cc002e1b1f5eb3d00414afb4199f164e3ee14d35c7145bee5",
      "text": "Jangan menyesal terus, nasi sudah menjadi bubur.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "33e243084f4f7b6c598d720eea1e1815e78f54adb1c1bc61a3857f96aecedf94",
      "text": "Jadi adat dan syarak saling menjaga.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 36,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3b768cb4a581dbc4690ed2c7cac12f25cb62c7e91fab3e340217be751c2b5e2e",
      "text": "Seperti kata pepatah, air beriak tanda tak dalam.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3d277d1476d6af9faca0ad32f5841ab9323e905f1696766e96a0573311963061",
      "text": "Gading yang paling indah pun bisa retak.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 40,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "50ba73ff3e185012e41fe2c1699908738ff68029fe9d34224aa18757a519e312",
      "text": "retak",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5139d501e84dd396218cd811e9018293351a26666b48227669ecb94fc7d19311",
      "text": "Betul. Lain lubuk lain ikannya, tetapi airnya sama-sama sungai.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "575b4960e024f5c993ebbf1a8a075983435890122ce4c955bcf2e472e33fc7e4",
      "text": "pepatah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5c4e927e8004c177a3317f5f02ff1cba23d0387f8ec29279988520d8014717f5",
      "text": "Setiap bahasa punya peribahasa tentang kesabaran.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5ca65b5187f8fb9b7dca66b7cdb70afa8448050487cee6b2f60716341730843f",
      "text": "bagai",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "609be3db3a2985ea977b664a45b6a28d879f999a76f317a2b1480728dc789235",
      "text": "Tidak apa-apa, tak ada gading yang tak retak.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "64594d01c288606dd2ee322341711c32a853f36cd149b257ec6fc472f110184e",
      "text": "sedikit demi sedikit",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 20,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6a6e58322d79b0f91226068205fe7407d630458332934e692fc5c7c957b7d386",
      "text": "Besok kamu ke Palembang. Apa yang paling kamu ingat dari ranah Minang?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 70,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6ab02b7c08ba6561e33a9aa09d7673fc5331b5793c48fc7d101813064afbb1e4",
      "text": "Tentu. Di Mesir kami bilang, \"Ya gharib, kun adib.\"",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "708f72a616a50f4af5fbc8108efcde082a157198a86e3d95ea1a87519c81541a",
      "text": "Aduh, maaf! Saya salah menghitung harga rendang untuk acara besok.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 66,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "70df002bf270e6be836a3f513dd413d1323ee2c85e7abce892d35dd16390f8ea",
      "text": "teguh",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "73b2b2128aba1fdde96433e40d5f3a8eceb21863505bc0b2193945a5e39487a1",
      "text": "Mohamed, di Mesir, siapa yang paling dihormati dalam keluarga besar?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7a836518fb5b068116b96a86df1e61212685ccf5026002777b908be9f93dc8d6",
      "text": "adat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7e7e20248830d873703b0f87a5250d8fc456844e35ad5b29707e8b38ffe730bc",
      "text": "Seperti kata pepatah, di mana bumi dipijak, di situ langit dijunjung.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "807bdc82099551330f7b15d2ff91e793e12361129ca8ce743418de0a81c7a9b2",
      "text": "menjunjung",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "847404623f42aea1f8294cdc5bad81df2e86165d410fc98d033d66af401431b1",
      "text": "sebaliknya",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "88f43a2b7227405fb4ed4cbe5e3296ca8afa1f6c07072bc88bb436391f56be49",
      "text": "Dulu saya tidur di surau ini. Kami belajar mengaji, silat, dan adat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "89133275fed5193abe28310c3d6eb4ec283eb34551a7a49fcaccaa7aa0a51880",
      "text": "Mamak saya selalu memberi nasihat tentang suku kami.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8df6fede8d0a72978f23944e125318419477676e7f1d9492df5cb6635e1d3d16",
      "text": "mufakat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8fd0356eb922fd03aa551b418e3c6de35e0d895610361de4313deb2faab6d1d7",
      "text": "Bagus! Jadi di rumah gadang nanti, kamu harus ikut adat Minang, ya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "93967604332da83170c60d1d0df5d72323528d2df92426696e98dab1f22a0d2c",
      "text": "bubur",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "988f7db368d90303386711adfbdddcfa9bf24af57ec1951b181fb4ca4b965613",
      "text": "kerabat",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "99c2f8965b6186ab72d5e0127de9db36feb92a9fca1db1c3023f40f79564e000",
      "text": "warisan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9d8cebacad25b1cd9bfe12ac19c88fbe2ddb12244997e4f67f1ca284377fed28",
      "text": "Uda Rafi. Saya belajar sedikit demi sedikit.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a392b2e91f275bdca736b2cd5cd17b51fea98fb8db65d7a6ac401337fcdaffdd",
      "text": "Kami belum mencapai mufakat, jadi kita bermusyawarah lagi besok.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "aa67575d7c3ce578c365c534616376859bc6d918bbdaefc132e87e277000a97f",
      "text": "Di surau, anak-anak belajar agama dan juga adat.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "aaa966d21d665fd4677d20f24b9e3dbc89ee2fa3181a09ab41b75bd4d053167f",
      "text": "Tetapi kita serupa dalam satu hal. Kerabat selalu datang saat ada masalah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 74,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ab262d7e0d8f52121b1e8293fb7a216b7cdb505e03a483130a32a79dca0b8ea8",
      "text": "Rumah ini pusaka, bukan warisan pribadi. Tugas saya lain, saya mamak untuk anak-anak adik saya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 95,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "add03ae3b45cbb1bdac3729619cb39d9aa3276cd59fb9471ab6c99b77f3e38fb",
      "text": "Mamak bertanggung jawab membimbing anak-anak saudara perempuannya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 66,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b4717ecc6dbe8f038c8d123a13fc4c164fa4f986975af90425c3ae37add0f0cb",
      "text": "Saat Lebaran, semua kerabat berkumpul di rumah nenek.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b5931956fb7b407e763a10e9cc10cc7e7d62aa81ec6f59e5d9d467a7b484deaf",
      "text": "Suku saya sama dengan suku ibu saya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 36,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bdc7f9656e57a7b2fc90ceb6149185f7a30ca57d58c5ebc3ba75e86a7981c914",
      "text": "garis keturunan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 15,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c593da09770c1c6cca842ded0e65c2d3c043933d2afc620f39205bee496179d7",
      "text": "Atap rumah gadang yang seperti tanduk kerbau, dan adat yang bersendi syarak.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 76,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c9cdb20aa5b906bc75fbc5f21ffe1c56978acab34e1b2fe75b54d2241bdcaa74",
      "text": "Rumah gadang itu pusaka yang turun ke anak perempuan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ca7a283ade21f706079f87a1e4bcc1688a55b69dcf6387e6be86d3d1a5a4525c",
      "text": "Seperti kata pepatah, lain lubuk lain ikannya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ca9c7626a03ea35f3d49cf5a8883ecde5e3eb8de60ac4b0375bee5f79555c9f3",
      "text": "pusaka",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d045fc82c46416a48894f75a54c6040e39ca27447c8ffe12ef1429b18ee60d9d",
      "text": "Wah, Mohamed sudah pakai peribahasa! Siapa yang mengajar?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 57,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d23be193a6d0b28cc6c432dfae7bdc01335a97017d4f92dcdb4884466ae8c032",
      "text": "Kalau kita bersatu, tim kita akan tetap teguh.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "db7f7767220a53151b90479c1efe3029566ec4b4fe4cf94e44ca2b6721c2aa88",
      "text": "Selamat datang di Bukittinggi, Mohamed. Di sini orang suka berbicara dengan peribahasa.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 87,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "de2517e3e31b1289cb42a50ce5435c5119c8a5654c97d3a8668c49a715c293d0",
      "text": "bersendi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e0d991d286a1f2a0c2ee7d09a93b764f67ec2f5e318db6df802710859587cad4",
      "text": "Tidak apa-apa, Uni. Tak ada gading yang tak retak.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e16b4f94f8cdcefe60c3930cc36aa827ab4f31ea5b186e63acc005d2e44f53ff",
      "text": "gading",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e2485fba5a9ac18e35c9c6fc2ccae3b098f2f5141a9663cd7320bd3931ae0490",
      "text": "suku",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e6b181c206c5ffff9c29b34775e8d88a6573a8822b874b2c69a186552f4e7751",
      "text": "Tanah pusaka itu milik keluarga ibu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 36,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f04254dab5890a9f7e3185e3afb21fdc0f39e589d0dec476c327d33d9e0feebd",
      "text": "peribahasa",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f0df48d62e0c730a11d5114b8abd5679b8d9b54a6a6c58f0444951c4fb68c3c1",
      "text": "… di situ langit dijunjung. Terima kasih, Uda. Utang budi saya besar.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f548f49e20a3494f7019a8fe236e58983bbc20c761407fd84dc62eb9cb019afe",
      "text": "Saya tahu satu, Uda. Di mana bumi dipijak, di situ langit dijunjung.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f8e93b1eb7c6524c8c44b48453a0e96b9ac349247824e1a9a5d1f91bc6aa3d57",
      "text": "Seperti kuttab di Mesir! Tetapi bagaimana adat matrilineal cocok dengan syarak?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 79,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
